  <questiondescription format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p id="concept">Navigation: new longitude after sailing along a parallel</p><p id="description">Grade 12 CBE Core 2.7 (e) / Essential 2.3 (e): Find the distance sailed along a parallel from speed and time, the change in longitude and the new longitude.</p><p id="edition">Core and Essential</p><p id="provenance">This question is adapted from Chapter 3 (The sphere), Exercise E, question 5 of School Mathematics Project, SMP Book 5 (Metric), ed. P. G. Bowie, Cambridge University Press, 1969: new longitude after sailing along a parallel; speed and time added, new numbers.</p><p id="citation">INNODEMS CBC Grade 12 Mathematics, first draft by Ben Davies, 2026. Aligned to the KICD Senior School Curriculum Design, Core and Essential Mathematics Grade 12 (draft).</p>]]></text></questiondescription>
